ts from pre- to early pandemic periods were tabulated, overall and within age-sex strata.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses were conducted using SAS (version 9.4; SAS Institute).\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"These analyses were limited to EDs with consistent ≥90% completeness for patient discharge diagnosis to ensure data quality\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}